WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.128 --> 00:00:17.529
and his companions were walking through a forest.

2
00:00:17.549 --> 00:00:22.452
"I'm glad the road goes through this shady forest," said the Tang Monk.

3
00:00:23.173 --> 00:00:24.894
"The sun is very hot this morning."

4
00:00:25.914 --> 00:00:26.795
Wujing nodded.

5
00:00:27.075 --> 00:00:28.756
"It's nice to walk in the shade."

6
00:00:29.972 --> 00:00:31.953
Wukong looked around suspiciously.

7
00:00:33.053 --> 00:00:35.855
He knew that forests were often filled with dangers.

8
00:00:37.195 --> 00:00:39.736
Suddenly Bajie fell flat on his face.

9
00:00:39.756 --> 00:00:45.279
"Oof!" He climbed back to his feet and rubbed his nose.

10
00:00:46.560 --> 00:00:47.660
okay," he said.

11
00:00:47.680 --> 00:00:50.501
"I tripped on a rock."

12
00:00:53.062 --> 00:00:56.044
The travelers soon came to a wall running along the road.

13
00:00:57.948 --> 00:01:00.230
the wall they could see the roof of a house.

14
00:01:01.330 --> 00:01:02.571
Up ahead was a gate.

15
00:01:04.012 --> 00:01:06.153
"I wonder who lives here," said Wujing.

16
00:01:06.173 --> 00:01:10.035
"Shh," said Wukong.

17
00:01:10.055 --> 00:01:11.396
"I hear laughter."

18
00:01:12.256 --> 00:01:13.837
The monkey peeked over the wall.

19
00:01:14.818 --> 00:01:17.879
Three young women were laughing and kicking a ball around.

20
00:01:17.899 --> 00:01:22.062
"I see three young women," said Wukong.

21
00:01:23.142 --> 00:01:26.632
"Let's ask them for some food," said Wujing.

22
00:01:26.912 --> 00:01:28.653
a good idea," said Bajie.

23
00:01:28.673 --> 00:01:30.233
"I'll go talk to them."

24
00:01:30.973 --> 00:01:32.574
The pig headed toward the gate.

25
00:01:34.274 --> 00:01:36.115
wait here," said the Tang Monk.

26
00:01:37.195 --> 00:01:38.535
He looked at his companions.

27
00:01:39.936 --> 00:01:40.796
will speak to the women.

28
00:01:41.476 --> 00:01:42.777
You three might frighten them."

29
00:01:43.677 --> 00:01:44.537
"Frighten them?"

30
00:01:44.817 --> 00:01:45.837
Bajie echoed.

31
00:01:47.418 --> 00:01:48.338
said the Tang Monk.

32
00:01:48.358 --> 00:01:53.259
"After all, Bajie, you're a large, talking pig.

33
00:01:53.800 --> 00:01:54.960
you're big and purple.

34
00:01:56.148 --> 00:01:58.710
And, Wukong, you're scary sometimes."

35
00:02:00.471 --> 00:02:01.392
The monkey shrugged.

36
00:02:02.833 --> 00:02:03.774
Wujing nodded.

37
00:02:03.794 --> 00:02:07.777
"Fine," snapped Bajie.

38
00:02:11.960 --> 00:02:13.941
Tang Monk opened the gate and went through.

39
00:02:16.383 --> 00:02:19.925
He approached the women.

40
00:02:20.025 --> 00:02:21.627
"Look!" said one woman.

41
00:02:21.647 --> 00:02:23.288
"We have a visitor."

42
00:02:24.276 --> 00:02:26.517
"He's a monk," said another woman.

43
00:02:26.537 --> 00:02:28.597
"What can we do for you?"

44
00:02:28.917 --> 00:02:29.698
asked the third.

45
00:02:29.718 --> 00:02:32.978
"Hello," said the Tang Monk.

46
00:02:33.939 --> 00:02:37.100
"I'm wondering if you could spare some food for my companions and me."

47
00:02:40.240 --> 00:02:41.881
The three women smiled.

48
00:02:41.901 --> 00:02:45.442
"Of course we can spare some food!"

49
00:02:45.702 --> 00:02:46.582
said the first woman.

50
00:02:46.602 --> 00:02:49.903
"We have plenty," said the second woman.

51
00:02:49.923 --> 00:02:53.124
"Come inside our house," said the third.

52
00:02:54.036 --> 00:02:57.259
The three young women led the Tang Monk into their house.

53
00:03:00.321 --> 00:03:03.084
As soon as the monk entered, he became scared.

54
00:03:04.445 --> 00:03:07.568
The interior of the house was dark and dreary.

55
00:03:08.769 --> 00:03:12.392
Dust covered everything, and cobwebs hung from the walls.

56
00:03:12.412 --> 00:03:15.654
"Tell us, monk," said one woman.

57
00:03:15.674 --> 00:03:18.817
"Why are you walking through our forest today?"

58
00:03:19.958 --> 00:03:22.100
The Tang Monk looked around nervously.

59
00:03:23.568 --> 00:03:30.831
"I, um I'm going to the Western Paradise to—" "You're the Tang Monk!"

60
00:03:31.251 --> 00:03:32.532
shrieked all three women.

61
00:03:33.632 --> 00:03:35.353
Tang Monk took a step back.

62
00:03:35.993 --> 00:03:37.594
"You've heard of me?"

63
00:03:39.014 --> 00:03:40.835
"Of course," said one woman.

64
00:03:41.635 --> 00:03:43.856
All three women reached behind their heads.

65
00:03:45.017 --> 00:03:48.718
They began to pull out long strands of spider silk.

66
00:03:50.059 --> 00:03:52.680
Swiftly they moved toward the Tang Monk.

67
00:03:57.407 --> 00:04:00.069
"What's taking Master so long?"

68
00:04:00.449 --> 00:04:01.330
asked Wukong.

69
00:04:02.291 --> 00:04:05.173
The monk's companions were waiting outside in the road.

70
00:04:05.193 --> 00:04:11.357
"He's probably inside that house, enjoying a nice meal," said Bajie.

71
00:04:11.377 --> 00:04:15.020
"Meanwhile, we're out here, starving."

72
00:04:15.040 --> 00:04:21.044
"The Tang Monk wouldn't do that, Bajie," said Wujing.

73
00:04:21.464 --> 00:04:22.165
looked worried.

74
00:04:22.185 --> 00:04:24.165
"We'd better check on Master."

75
00:04:26.026 --> 00:04:29.107
there's food, I want to be there," said Bajie.

76
00:04:29.127 --> 00:04:30.588
"I'll go with you."

77
00:04:32.009 --> 00:04:33.409
two of them went to the gate.

78
00:04:34.810 --> 00:04:37.431
When they saw the house, they both gasped.

79
00:04:41.572 --> 00:04:43.913
"The house is covered in spiderwebs!"

80
00:04:44.213 --> 00:04:44.934
cried the pig.

81
00:04:46.734 --> 00:04:50.156
Wukong kicked in the gate, and they rushed toward the house.

82
00:04:51.340 --> 00:04:52.781
The monkey banged on the door.

83
00:04:52.801 --> 00:04:53.801
"Open up!"

84
00:04:55.162 --> 00:04:56.283
The door flew open.

85
00:04:57.243 --> 00:05:01.606
The three women leaped out, shooting sticky webs at Wukong and Bajie.

86
00:05:02.986 --> 00:05:05.708
The pig waved his rake.

87
00:05:05.748 --> 00:05:09.450
Webs wrapped around it, and soon the weapon was stuck to his head.

88
00:05:12.671 --> 00:05:16.634
Bajie turned to run, but more webs flew toward him.

89
00:05:17.494 --> 00:05:20.756
They wrapped around his legs, and he fell to the ground.
